ury","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game against UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T14:39:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chris Creighton out as coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons","description":"Chris Creighton is out as head coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons with the school.","published":"2026-11-25T19:05:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5218778/will-echoles","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Will_Echoles"},"pick":{"pick":14,"round":1,"team":"WSH","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Will Echoles","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Will_Echoles","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-25T17:07:13Z","intro":"William Jamierous Echoles (born August 7, 2006) is an American college football defensive tackle for the Ole Miss Rebels.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Echoles attended Houston High School in Houston, Mississippi, where he played both defensive and offensive line. As a senior, he was the 4A Mississippi Mr. Football and 4A MHSAA Defensive Player of the Year after recording 59 tackles and seven sacks. Echoles was selected to play in the 2024 All-American Bowl. He committed to the University of Mississippi (Ole Miss) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Ole Miss in 2024, Echoles appeared in eight games and had nine tackles and 0.5 sacks. He returned to Ole Miss as a starter his sophomore year in 2025."}]}}